  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "GroundCUA",
  "description": "\n  GroundCUA: Grounding Computer Use Agents on Human Demonstrations\n\n\n\n\n\ud83c\udf10 Website |\n\ud83d\udcd1 Paper |\n\ud83e\udd17 Dataset |\n\ud83e\udd16 Models\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tGroundCUA Dataset\n\t\n\nGroundCUA is a large and diverse dataset of real UI screenshots paired with structured annotations for building multimodal computer use agents. It covers 87 software platforms across productivity tools, browsers, creative tools, communication apps, development environments, and system utilities. GroundCUA is designed for research on GUI\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ServiceNow/GroundCUA.",
